```
Title: DNS Query to Wildcard DNS Services - Windows
Author: MahirAli Khan, Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
Date: 2026-11-05
Level: medium
Description: Detects DNS queries to public wildcard DNS services that dynamically resolve subdomains to IP addresses embedded in the subdomain.
 Adversaries abuse these services to establish C2 channels or stage phishing infrastructure without registering a custom domain, potentially to evade detection and attribution.
MITRE Tactic: Command and Control
Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1071.004, attack.t1568
Reference: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/dns_query/dns_query_win_wildcard_dns_service.yml
 False Positives:
   - Developers on Windows workstations testing local services or web applications without editing the hosts file
```
QueryName IN ("*.1u.ms", "*.backname.io", "*.nip.io", "*.sslip.io", "*.traefik.me", "*.xip.io")